Server init.

>> x := Blob okusha: 65 uhlobo: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Uhlelo isilungiselelo: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server xhuma: (
 Uhlu okusha ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Uhlu okusha ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x kusuka: 0 ubude: 1), umugqa-omusha.
x khulula.

